    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out our game of origin!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/e96c2adb86cd673e358adedf61538d50.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>If you love adorable Naomi, don't forget to check out our game of origin <i><strong>&quot;Uberich: Advent Sinners&quot;</strong></i>. They share the same origin and use the same characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.poster.avif?t=1751622917\" width=188 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.webm?t=1751622917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.mp4?t=1751622917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.poster.avif?t=1751622917\" width=188 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.webm?t=1751622917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.mp4?t=1751622917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.poster.avif?t=1751622917\" width=188 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.webm?t=1751622917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b3ce1a71f8ad323abc5ee486a384e33b.mp4?t=1751622917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b5b0fe0bff4faa4eb072ea1a18bb4f4c.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=276 /></span><br><br>The Great Naomi Hunt!<br>In the world of simple lines, Naomi is playing hide-and-seek for mysterious reasons.<br>Your keen eye and sharp observation skills will be put to the test as you search for a large amount of unique Naomis, each with their own quirky charm waiting to be uncovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><br>&gt; Multiple beautifully designed levels!<br>&gt; 44 Naomis per level!<br>&gt; Catchy tunes!<br>&gt; Handy hint button!<br>&gt; Intuitive controls!<br>&gt; 71 achievements in the first 2 levels!<br>&gt; Leaderboards!<br>&gt; Inherit DEMO progress!<br>&gt; Inherit DEMO achievements!<br>&gt; Super adorable Naomis!<br>&gt; Wacky Naomi varieties!<br>&gt; Completely hidden Naomis too!<br><br>Can you find them all? Capture the simple fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/2d90b36f1be2a9e25288492721efaf05.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=536 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/84ef8327011132680ccc93fefdc41743.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=536 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/450e860cfa3ae6aaa836a13341fe3c5c.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=536 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/b5b0fe0bff4faa4eb072ea1a18bb4f4c.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=276 /></span><br><br>The Great Naomi Hunt!<br>In the world of simple lines, Naomi is playing hide-and-seek for mysterious reasons.<br>Your keen eye and sharp observation skills will be put to the test as you search for a large amount of unique Naomis, each with their own quirky charm waiting to be uncovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><br>&gt; Multiple beautifully designed levels!<br>&gt; 44 Naomis per level!<br>&gt; Catchy tunes!<br>&gt; Handy hint button!<br>&gt; Intuitive controls!<br>&gt; 71 achievements in the first 2 levels!<br>&gt; Leaderboards!<br>&gt; Inherit DEMO progress!<br>&gt; Inherit DEMO achievements!<br>&gt; Super adorable Naomis!<br>&gt; Wacky Naomi varieties!<br>&gt; Completely hidden Naomis too!<br><br>Can you find them all? Capture the simple fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/2d90b36f1be2a9e25288492721efaf05.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=536 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/84ef8327011132680ccc93fefdc41743.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=536 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151340/extras/450e860cfa3ae6aaa836a13341fe3c5c.avif?t=1751622917\" width=616 height=536 /></span>",
